<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.75/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.75/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.75 to mostly $1.00 lower. Trade moderate. Top $59.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.50-59.75, mostly 59.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows: 300-550 lbs steady to 0.50 lower; 550-700 lbs 1.00</p>
<p>higher  on  a thin test. Top 56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs	49.00</p>
<p>	   400-450 lbs	50.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	scarce</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	54.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	56.00</p>
</text>
